  1: """
  2: tests/test_assessment_findings.py - Reproduction & Verification Tests for Assessment Report Findings
  3: 
  4: Validates fixes for:
  5:   - F-01: Copy-based exfiltration / removable media detection
  6:   - F-02: Substring matching false CRITICAL alerts (report_template.docx, attempt2.txt, Templates folder, tmpuser)
  7:   - F-03: Ignore rule evasion (secret.pem.tmp, leak.zip.part)
  8:   - F-04: Own-folder prefix match (Downloads sibling folder Downloads2)
  9:   - F-05: .git / .vscode exact folder matching (.github, .gitconfig)
 10:   - F-06: Creating file in suspicious folder returns CRITICAL
 11:   - F-07: Removable-drive detection for all drive letters (E:, Z:, etc.)
 12:   - F-08: Directory events not skipped
 13:   - F-09: Process attribution not claiming FileSentinel PID
 14:   - F-10: Destination file type evaluated on rename (notes.txt -> notes.pem)
 15:   - F-11: Debounce allows rapid legitimate edits with content change
 16:   - F-12: Network-share check with forward slashes (//server/share)
 17:   - F-13: Invalid hash algorithm returns None without unhandled exception
 18:   - F-14: Dynamic folder resolution (OneDrive redirection, cloud sync roots)
 19: """
