 73: ├── monitor.py                # Watchdog filesystem observer & debouncing pipeline
 74: ├── detector.py               # Classification logic for sensitive files and exfiltration paths
 75: ├── hasher.py                 # Cryptographic hashing & pre/post transfer integrity verification
 76: ├── logger.py                 # Structured JSON audit logging & console output
