216: - **Data Loss Prevention (DLP):** Tracks unauthorized movement of corporate and confidential file types to external endpoints.
217: - **Tamper Detection:** Computes cryptographic pre/post hashes to verify that transferred files have not been modified or corrupted in transit.
218: - **Insider Threat Monitoring:** Captures operating system username and triggering process metadata for every file transfer event.
